---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const path = (value: string) => `${base}${value}`;
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div>
    <p class="footer-brand">Go Moalboal</p>
    <p>A community-made guide to discovering, living and helping in Moalboal.</p>
    <p>Information on this website is community-maintained. Spotted something wrong? <a href={path('/contact')}>Let us know.</a></p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Independent, community-first</p>
    <p>Go Moalboal is not an official municipal website. It is an independent community service made by a Moalboal local, using world-class web technology to make local knowledge easier to find.</p>
  </div>
  <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Go Moalboal</p>
</footer>
